::drc::add_waiver \
	-description {The register mem_used[0] in the ace5lite_cache_coherency_translator write_rsp_fifo exhibits high timing path endpoint tension due to how the Quartus fitter routes its high fanout connections. This is intermittent and does not indicate a functional or timing violation.} \
